WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.111
Watch and read: While at the market, Ama thinks about this: What are the initials of

00:00:05.111 --> 00:00:05.725
Ama Boateng?

00:00:06.533 --> 00:00:10.053
The answer is: A. B.. Use capital letters for initials.

00:00:10.867 --> 00:00:16.138
Watch and read: Kojo is learning with a partner at school. Which correctly writes the

00:00:16.138 --> 00:00:17.544
initials of Kojo Mensah?

00:00:18.367 --> 00:00:22.015
The answer is: K. M.. Initials take capital letters.
